[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4764284694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113225#issuecomment-4764284694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113225","id":4764284694,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG_k3Fg","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T02:54:21Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T02:55:03Z","body":"Out of curiosity, could this be a project setting instead (with a CLI argument to override it)? This would allow non-game applications to make use of this feature without needing to compile custom export template binaries.\r\n\r\nThe new CLI argument could also make use of `--gpu-index` functionality behind the scenes when using a RenderingDevice-based renderer.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4764284694/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4765674525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113225#issuecomment-4765674525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113225","id":4765674525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHA5sHQ","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T06:55:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T06:55:17Z","body":"@Calinou Thanks for the suggestion! I did consider a project setting, but I believe a build-time option is the only viable approach here.\r\nOn Windows, the OpenGL compatibility renderer selects the GPU based on either:\r\n\r\n- Registry settings (if configured)\r\n- The exported NvOptimusEnablement / AmdPowerXpressRequestHighPerformance symbols (the fallback)\r\n\r\nThese symbols are resolved at link time, meaning the GPU preference is baked into the binary before the program even launches. Unlike Vulkan, where the RenderingDevice backend can enumerate and select adapters at runtime (via --gpu-index), there is no equivalent runtime API for OpenGL on Windows.\r\nConsequently, a project setting or CLI argument wouldn't be able to influence GPU selection for the OpenGL backend, as the OS/driver has already decided by the time the engine starts. This is precisely why a compile-time switch is necessary for applications that want to defer to the OS/driver default.\r\nPlease let me know if I missed an alternative approach.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4765674525/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4774750665","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113225#issuecomment-4774750665","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113225","id":4774750665,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHJjpyQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T01:26:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T01:26:40Z","body":"@bruvzg Any ideas?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4774750665/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4776504402","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113225#issuecomment-4776504402","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113225","id":4776504402,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHLOsUg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T06:48:46Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T06:48:46Z","body":"Runtime change might be possible using custom vendor API (e.g., `nvapi64.dll`), but not with these symbols.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4776504402/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/